        "bbox": [
          526.0,
          619.0,
          922.0,
          773.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Dielectric measurements were carried out by means of a Novocontrol Broad Band Dielectric Spectrometer made up of an Alpha analyzer to carry out measurement from $1 0 ^ { - 1 } ~ \\mathrm { t o } ~ 1 0 ^ { 6 }$Hz and an Agilent 4991A RF analyzer to perform measurements from ${ 1 0 } ^ { 6 }$to ${ 1 0 } ^ { 8 }$Hz, both devices being coupled with a Quatro temperature controller. Isothermal measurements were carried out from 148 to 423 K in 5-K steps on a molded, disc-shaped (diameter of 20 and 10 mm, respectively) sample."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "condition_id": "mc003",
      "other_conditions": {
        "force_field": "MMX",
        "software": "PCMODEL",
        "dielectric_constant": "1.5"
      },
