        "page": 1,
        "bbox": [
          526.0,
          818.0,
          922.0,
          910.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "MM calculations were performed using the force field method developed by Allinger and coworkers.<sup>15–18</sup>. The PC-MODEL software<sup>19</sup> was employed to carry out the calculations. It is based on an empirical force field, called MMX that is derived from MM2(P).<sup>20</sup> Parameterization of MMX has been carried out, assuming an artificial dielectric constant of 1.5."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.8
      }
    }
